Package: gitrialsim
Title: Simulation-Guided Trial Design for Gastroenterology and Hepatology
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tarek Ziad", "Arabi", email = "arabi.tarek@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A parameterization and orchestration layer for planning
    gastroenterology and hepatology randomised trials. Clinical scenarios are
    described by versioned, fully cited parameter packs; designs are evaluated
    by delegating to validated engines ('rpact' and 'gsDesign') rather than
    reimplementing their statistics, and by Monte Carlo simulation for designs
    whose operating characteristics have no closed form. Results are reported
    following the ADEMP framework of Morris, White and Crowther (2019)
    <doi:10.1002/sim.8086> with Monte Carlo standard errors on every
    performance measure.
